{"id":"dec-intent","phase":"intent","kind":"framing","title":"Make the look-up the only opening in the song","objective":"Turn the brief into one audible change of posture.","decision":"Frame the song as head-down waiting, one look-up anchor (ふと見上げたら 白いひとひら), and a quiet coda; ひとひら is the semantic focus.","rationale":"The brief forbids saying the singer feels better, so the change has to live in register, entry, duration, and texture.","alternatives":[{"option":"A verse/chorus song with a lyrical turn","disposition":"rejected","reason":"Too big for 30 seconds and invites a 'big chorus'."}],"expected_audible_effect":"A listener notices the line lift and the texture open at bar 7 without needing the words.","affected_object_ids":["intro","verse","lift","coda"],"artifact_ids":[],"listening_question_id":"lq-look-up","hash_dependencies":["intent"],"supersedes_decision_ids":[],"evidence":{"constraints":[],"observations":["composition_intent declares song, four section intents, and anchor pd-look-up."],"theory_issue_codes":[],"metric_deltas":[]},"outcome":"implemented","author":{"type":"agent","name":"claude-opus-5-5"},"schema":"vocaloid-creative-decision-journal/v1","sequence":1,"created_at":"2026-11-15T08:44:09.568Z","song_id":"hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115","binding":{"manifest_path":"/home/pentester/coding/codex_ida/vocaloid/build/cold-start-songs/hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115/hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115.song.json","manifest_revision":10,"content_hash":"8b8a3eac57d429e45f3196afdadddf6a0ff26fa08ad305ac65ff3fc695b220ed","composition_hash":"8d7cc4679d214834e7f394ede913e606eb41bdc649e494c10bbff5fe586e5bc6","mix_hash":"860cc8b9a6daeeac07c91029e14b207004e035e35a528a3fed07f458eabb19a6","intent_hash":"d58d931ff6fbd69b38d871f61ccb6af04cfbfd05c8d89945d27abcff6565cc63","object_fingerprints":{"intro":"60283e9f6a44ebcc5b98c57542a941a7ce61060f7eb77bd9e8877fdb2bb6531d","verse":"3bb4a5521594819d1590a344e2deb37cd607319e8e7b2ec4c43d744c3a44f19e","lift":"30125cba41