{"id":"dec-harmony","phase":"harmony","kind":"selection","title":"Withhold the tonic until the coda","objective":"Keep the worry unresolved and let the flake sit on a soft colour.","decision":"Bm7-Gmaj7 for the waiting verse ending on Asus4-A; Gadd9 and D/F# for the look-up; Em7 to F#m7 under ひとひら; G, D/F#, Gmaj7, Dadd9 in the coda.","rationale":"Starting on the relative minor keeps the verse grey; F#m7 under the focus word is luminous without resolving, so the only real arrival is the final Dadd9.","alternatives":[{"option":"A major under ひとひら (first draft)","disposition":"rejected","reason":"Put the lead's F# on a sixth over A and forced non-chord tones into the harmony voice."}],"expected_audible_effect":"Slight lift of colour at the flake, quiet settling only at the end.","affected_object_ids":["chord-08","chord-10","chord-11","chord-15"],"artifact_ids":[],"hash_dependencies":["composition"],"supersedes_decision_ids":[],"evidence":{"constraints":[],"observations":["Preflight warnings dropped from 19 to 6 after the revision; remaining LEADING_TONE_UNRESOLVED are C# chord tones in deliberately unresolved bars."],"theory_issue_codes":["LEADING_TONE_UNRESOLVED"],"metric_deltas":[]},"outcome":"implemented","author":{"type":"agent","name":"claude-opus-5-5"},"schema":"vocaloid-creative-decision-journal/v1","sequence":4,"created_at":"2026-11-15T08:44:09.667Z","song_id":"hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115","binding":{"manifest_path":"/home/pentester/coding/codex_ida/vocaloid/build/cold-start-songs/hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115/hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115.song.json","manifest_revision":10,"content_hash":"8b8a3eac57d429e45f3196afdadddf6a0ff26fa08ad305ac65ff3fc695b220ed","composition_hash":"8d7cc4679d214834e7f394ede913e606eb41bdc649e494c10bbff5fe586e5bc6","mix_hash":"860cc8b9a6daeeac07c91029e14b207004e035e35a528a3fed07f458eabb19a6","intent_hash":"d58d931ff6fbd69b38d871f61ccb6af04cfbfd05c8d89945d27abcff6565cc63","object_fingerprints":{"chord-08":"28ae78b206