{"id":"dec-melody","phase":"melody","kind":"selection","title":"Late, sinking verse lines; downbeat, rising anchor","objective":"Make the look-up a change of melodic posture.","decision":"Verse lines enter late on eighths inside B3-E4 and fall at their ends; ふと見上げたら enters on beat one and climbs D4 to B4 with a breath after ふと; ひとひら moves to quarters and peaks on A4.","rationale":"Entry position, contour, and note length are the three things a listener feels as 'looking up'.","alternatives":[{"option":"Raise the whole melody an octave in the lift","disposition":"rejected","reason":"A jump would sound like an announcement instead of noticing."}],"expected_audible_effect":"The first downbeat entry and the first notes above E4 arrive together at bar 7.","affected_object_ids":["lead-v1","lead-v2","lead-l1","lead-l2","lead-c1"],"artifact_ids":[],"hash_dependencies":["composition"],"supersedes_decision_ids":[],"evidence":{"constraints":[],"observations":["Phrase grammar: 2 distinct entry positions, largest contour cluster 1 of 5, no concentration findings."],"theory_issue_codes":[],"metric_deltas":[]},"outcome":"implemented","author":{"type":"agent","name":"claude-opus-5-5"},"schema":"vocaloid-creative-decision-journal/v1","sequence":5,"created_at":"2026-11-15T08:44:09.698Z","song_id":"hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115","binding":{"manifest_path":"/home/pentester/coding/codex_ida/vocaloid/build/cold-start-songs/hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115/hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115.song.json","manifest_revision":10,"content_hash":"8b8a3eac57d429e45f3196afdadddf6a0ff26fa08ad305ac65ff3fc695b220ed","composition_hash":"8d7cc4679d214834e7f394ede913e606eb41bdc649e494c10bbff5fe586e5bc6","mix_hash":"860cc8b9a6daeeac07c91029e14b207004e035e35a528a3fed07f458eabb19a6","intent_hash":"d58d931ff6fbd69b38d871f61ccb6af04cfbfd05c8d89945d27abcff6565cc63","object_fingerprints":{"lead-v1":"8f0f19c8711dda5ccec8ac0de8647a3ef18b966478132dff5ae676757c842b1e","lead-v2":"a1854f9730bbf8830925a8