{"id":"dec-allocation","phase":"note_allocation","kind":"selection","title":"One mora per note except two melismas","objective":"Keep the lyric conversational and under the breath.","decision":"Explicit allocation with one mora per note; melisma only on しゃ (resolving the Asus4 in the melody) and on the last ら of ひとひら; a rest after ふと as a caught breath.","rationale":"Speech-like setting fits muttering to oneself; the two melismas sit exactly where the harmony or the focus needs time.","alternatives":[],"expected_audible_effect":"The words stay clear; the flake word lingers.","affected_object_ids":["lead-v2-cell-8","lead-l1-cell-3","lead-l2-cell-8"],"artifact_ids":[],"hash_dependencies":["composition"],"supersedes_decision_ids":[],"evidence":{"constraints":[],"observations":["Japanese readings supplied for every kanji; zero G2P fallbacks."],"theory_issue_codes":[],"metric_deltas":[]},"outcome":"implemented","author":{"type":"agent","name":"claude-opus-5-5"},"schema":"vocaloid-creative-decision-journal/v1","sequence":6,"created_at":"2026-11-15T08:44:09.722Z","song_id":"hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115","binding":{"manifest_path":"/home/pentester/coding/codex_ida/vocaloid/build/cold-start-songs/hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115/hatsuyuki-platform-ia-rocks-20261115.song.json","manifest_revision":10,"content_hash":"8b8a3eac57d429e45f3196afdadddf6a0ff26fa08ad305ac65ff3fc695b220ed","composition_hash":"8d7cc4679d214834e7f394ede913e606eb41bdc649e494c10bbff5fe586e5bc6","mix_hash":"860cc8b9a6daeeac07c91029e14b207004e035e35a528a3fed07f458eabb19a6","intent_hash":"d58d931ff6fbd69b38d871f61ccb6af04cfbfd05c8d89945d27abcff6565cc63","object_fingerprints":{"lead-v2-cell-8":"e455aca4d9a19d7d8c03b38425fd80623a48a8ad1838b53b65471a0662b6c517","lead-l1-cell-3":"66739b6d8da8d467ff995df8b399290bd5f51f47b5f7797dbe16e089ae9a8989","lead-l2-cell-8":"a087f8e24c1d6b83de9602e45bd6320662b56f9cb8902507227c30315af3c810"},"artifacts":[]},"previous_entry_hash":"a6510f87b6fd5f04054f39ca259a015f19f